        "title": "Point the node-click hit-test at the new path",
        "body": "In WorkspaceLayer.js's activateAt: when the click hit-tests onto a node inside a passive graph (the \"if (node) { workspace.activate(instance.instanceId, node.id); return; }\" branch), call the new selectNodeInInstance instead of activate. Leave the empty-card-space branch (selectInstances only) exactly as is.",
        "status": "done",
        "owner": "",
        "priority": "high",
        "estimateHours": "",
        "acceptanceCriteria": [
          "Node-click branch in activateAt calls the new narrower action",
          "Empty-space click branch is untouched",
          "Header Focus button and other explicit-focus call sites still call the full activate/activateInstance path"
        ],
