        "body": "Goal: Selecting a node inside a graph must not, by itself, change which graph anchors the workspace layout\nStatus: done\n\nTasks in scope:\n1. Add a node-select path that does not touch focusedGraphInstanceId\n2. Point the node-click hit-test at the new path\n3. Audit every other activate() call site\n4. Prove the reflow no longer fires from a stray node click\n\nOpen questions:\n1. Should selecting a node in a passive graph still pan the camera to center on it?",
        "estimateHours": "",
